Package: colvR
Type: Package
Title: Poisson Lognormal with Dimension Reduction for Count Matrices with Missing Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Barbara", "Bricout",
           email = "barbara.bricout@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Impute missing data in count tables using a Poisson lognormal
    model with dimension reduction, with and without zero inflation, as
    described in Bricout et al. (2026) <arXiv:2602.10673>. Parameters are
    estimated with a variational expectation-maximization algorithm. The
    package also provides the asymptotic variance of the estimators,
    prediction intervals for the imputed counts, and model selection
    criteria (BIC and ICL) to choose the dimension of the latent space.
